{"id":"n84542-1-7","stage":2,"title":"하차 · 下车","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84542-1-7-1","ko":"시청으로 가려면 어디에서 내려야 해요?","zh":"去市政府的话，要在哪一站下车呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시청으로","meaning":"市政府，市厅","explanation":"시청：市政府，市厅；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"시청","audio":"/audio/d089c9bf766d3808ef00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65312","senseId":"1","lemma":"시청","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시청으로","audio":"/audio/95509d5be8f919ec70cf.mp3"}},{"text":"가려면","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；려면：表示实现意图所需的条件：“如果想要……”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가려면","audio":"/audio/fde17e82c40c3f9f5bb6.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에서","audio":"/audio/b7f2498da0de7d9f1c85.mp3"}},{"text":"내려야","meaning":"下","explanation":"내리다：下；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"6","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내려야","audio":"/audio/5e579403f5668f41077a.mp3"}},{"text":"해요?","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d089c9bf766d3808","term":"시청","zh":"市政府，市厅","audio":"/audio/d089c9bf766d3808ef00.mp3","entryId":"65312","definition":"负责市行政事务的机关。","pronunciation":["시ː청"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"01d776172b3f93c3","term":"내리다","zh":"下","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3","entryId":"73353","definition":"从乘坐的工具上出来或到地面上站住。","pronunciation":["내리다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/93d5ee2c7b6742e2e667.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84542-1-7-2","ko":"두 정거장을 지난 뒤에 하차를 하세요.","zh":"过了两站之后再下车就可以了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两。","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"정거장을","meaning":"车站","explanation":"정거장：车站；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"정거장","audio":"/audio/6cc88bd83df3334b2402.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31739","senseId":"1","lemma":"정거장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정거장을","audio":"/audio/6c2126be73f1ef188c62.mp3"}},{"text":"지난","meaning":"过，经过","explanation":"지나다：过，经过；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"3","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지난","audio":"/audio/1589c16515823209ca51.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤에","meaning":"之后，下一个，接下来","explanation":"뒤：之后，下一个，接下来；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"5","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤에","audio":"/audio/0350898692fd4601facb.mp3"}},{"text":"하차를","meaning":"下车","explanation":"하차：下车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"하차","audio":"/audio/5c9110a2cf4211e0f219.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84542","senseId":"1","lemma":"하차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하차를","audio":"/audio/6bcf7dcf96452bd26fb6.mp3"}},{"text":"하세요.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하세요","audio":"/audio/20c70a963b62c0806108.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"6cc88bd83df3334b","term":"정거장","zh":"车站","audio":"/audio/6cc88bd83df3334b2402.mp3","entryId":"31739","definition":"为让人上下车，汽车或出租车等停车的地方。","pronunciation":["정거장"]},{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过，经过","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"通过某处去或来。","pronunciation":["지나다"]},{"id":"c65326b2de936236","term":"뒤","zh":"之后，下一个，接下来","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3","entryId":"67477","definition":"接着前一个。","pronunciation":["뒤ː"]},{"id":"5c9110a2cf4211e0","term":"하차","zh":"下车","audio":"/audio/5c9110a2cf4211e0f219.mp3","entryId":"84542","definition":"从乘坐的车辆上下来。","pronunciation":["하ː차"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d79587bba0674499676d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.33,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84542","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://